## Scope

The MIT license above covers the code written by the authors. It does not cover
material in this repository that we did not write and do not own. Wherever a
directory carries its own `LICENSE` or `NOTICE.md`, that file governs its contents
and takes precedence over this one:

| Path | Governed by |
|---|---|
| `web-data-collection-gcs/pages/fake_pages/instagram-clone/` | `LICENSE` — MIT, Leonardo Costa |
| `web-data-collection-gcs/pages/fake_pages/Facebook-Clone/` | `NOTICE.md` — third party, license unknown |
| `web-data-collection-gcs/pages/fake_pages/twitter-clone/` | `NOTICE.md` — third party, unlicensed upstream |
| `web-data-collection-gcs/pages/hosting/videos/` | `NOTICE.md` — copyrighted clips, included as fair use |

We claim copyright only over our own contributions to those directories, and license
those contributions under the MIT terms above. We grant no rights in the underlying
third-party material, because we hold none to grant.

`datasets/` holds human-subjects research data and is likewise not covered by the MIT
license. Its terms have not been settled yet; until they are, treat it as all rights
reserved.
